id: pm-web-github-ec206b5ea075-260
title: "Backend roadmap: bind authorized projects and realtime/history reads to native SDK backends"
description: "GH issue #260: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-web/issues/260 · author @unbraind · created 2026-10-25T16:20:56Z · updated 2026-10-25T16:24:12Z"
