  "2026-11-09T16:21:20.951Z",codex-agent,"Package audit: physical identity now governs the shared queue, client-cache lookup/eviction and graph-provision deduplication; the legacy historical-reader export also joins the queue. SQL source/index selection now uses regclass resolution on the active search path. Deferred multi-resource fixtures migrated to acquisition-time ownership; root-only factories clean up rejected setup; seeded SQL users have file-level fallback cleanup. Published Markdown links are checked across the package manifest and exact installed docs plus the shared alias adversary run in all four packed npm/Bun scenarios. Focused initial suites passed 46/46 plus class checks 3/3; broader focused gates and disposable-copy reverts are running. Existing owner-created remote merge c7f7d3e uses a different author identity; all agent commits retain the required bot identity. No history rewrite has been performed."
  "2026-11-09T16:25:08.395Z",codex-agent,"Disposable-copy behavioral revert proofs (fixed checkout untouched): reverting the three document revisions causes 1/1 failure; replacing physicalWorkspacePath with lexical resolution causes 2/2 failures (alias queue and cache/dispatch adversaries); removing acquisition-time cleanup registration causes 2/2 failures (partial real fixture acquisition and exhaustive cleanup boundaries); reverting only the SQL clone/catalog selection yields 1 passing configured-schema case and 1 failing non-public case (2 failed including parent); dropping board column items yields the board membership failure (2 failed including parent, 5 passed). All failures are assertions with exit 1, no cancellations. Fixed implementations restored in finally. Broad focused tests passed 162/162 with two workers; strengthened alias-provision acceptance and the fixed regressions are being rerun through the linked pm test."
