  "2026-11-09T17:52:25.685Z",codex-agent,"Final re-review handoff for PR 305: PRRT_kwDOSZgR5c61PvmA pins all follow-up links to a containing revision and validates every shipped Markdown blob link; PRRT_kwDOSZgR5c61PvmJ uses physical tracker identity for queues, SDK client cache/eviction, provisioning deduplication and legacy historical reads; PRRT_kwDOSZgR5c61PvmR owns cleanup at acquisition across partial fixtures and browser setup; PRRT_kwDOSZgR5c61PvmZ selects SQL source/index definitions through regclass and backend-quoted relation identity, including non-public quoted schemas. The review-body board membership nit is fixed too. Disposable behavioral reverts failed for all four findings, empty board columns, tracker-only aliases, provisioning deduplication and regex index rewriting; fixed implementations restored in finally. Final full npm release gate passed in 1807.9 seconds and full Bun release gate passed in 1416.3 seconds, each 954/954 tests with zero skipped/canceled, 80 required sources and unchanged thresholds (93.99% statements/lines, 85.58% branches, 97.65% functions), capacity 2/2, production audit zero vulnerabilities and packed consumers 4/4. Both gates validated identical tarball SHA-256 fcec2c0b117aee2e37877ad7abeff5420a054a9acf26ee0e633e8cb515fc8567. Broader targeted suite passed 162/162; final linked pm regression rerun passed 50/50. Static typecheck, lint, zero duplication, docstrings, changelog, release date and attestation passed. All agent commits use the required bot identity; inherited owner merge c7f7d3e retains its existing author and is the previously documented range-author exception. No history rewrite, PR-thread reply/resolution, merge or release was performed. Releasing only this agent claim; orchestrator owns review replies and item closure."
